                                                "sense_id": "1cfece8a-0f6a-37a6-87ea-b53e33ca9af8",
                                                "text": "The merpeople and the sentients who lived on the beach often hitched rides on these creatures, steering them by pressure on exposed nerve centers."
                                            }
                                        ]
